---
// Technology and brand marks, drawn as one 24px grid with the same construction as the icon
// set: a single geometry, currentColor, no gradients. They are simplified, not the official
// artwork — each one always sits beside its own text label, and the footer credits the
// trademarks to their owners. `laravel` is the site's own mark (docs/logo.svg), so the
// product's identity is the same shape in the header, the hero and here.
